Table full name: TCGA_HG19_DATA_V0.TCGA_HG19_DATA_V0.PROTEIN_EXPRESSION
Column name: aliquot_barcode Type: TEXT Description: Original TCGA aliquot barcode, eg TCGA-12-1089-01A-01D-0517-01
Column name: phospho Type: TEXT Description: If the antibody targets a phosphorylated protein, this field will contain that information, eg pS473  --  otherwise this field will be null
Column name: protein_base_name Type: TEXT Description: Protein name e.g. AR, MAPK
Column name: gene_name Type: TEXT Description: Gene name e.g. eg TTN, DDR1, etc
Column name: sample_barcode Type: TEXT Description: Original TCGA sample barcode, eg TCGA-12-1089-01A  --  note that one sample may have multiple aliquots and therefore multiple sets of CN segmentations; so be sure to use GROUP BY appropriately in your queries
Column name: protein_expression Type: FLOAT Description: Expression level of protein as measured by reverse-phase protein arrays. https://bioinformatics.mdanderson.org/public-software/tcpa/
Column name: case_barcode Type: TEXT Description: Original TCGA case barcode, eg TCGA-12-1089  --  note that each case typically has a primary-tumor sample and a matched-normal (blood or adjacent tissue) sample; please refer to the TCGA Biospecimen table for more details
Column name: protein_name Type: TEXT Description: Protein symbol with phosphorylation status, eg ACC_pS79
Column name: antibody_source Type: TEXT Description: Animal of origin for the antibody M (Mouse), R (Rabbit), G (Goat)
Column name: project_short_name Type: TEXT Description: Project name abbreviation; the program name appended with a project name abbreviation; eg. TCGA-OV, etc.
